      Commander!</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-93.0,"y":-5.0},"guid":"f284df51-0032-491f-be72-75e5fab6e563","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"53"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Through
      the night, your men have <b>raised fresh fortifications</b> atop this hill.
      They are <color=#C9C9C9>rough</color>. They are <color=#C9C9C9>incomplete</color>.
      They are all that stand before the enemy now.\\n\\n<b><color=#B22222>The British
      are coming.</color></b>\\nTheir ranks are trained, their bayonets fixed, and
      their cannon will not spare this ground.\\n\\nYou command a <b><color=#FF5C5C>desperate
      defense</color></b>. <b>Hold the line.</b> Make every shot count.\\n\\nIf they
      take this hill, make them <b><color=#FF3B30>fear the price.</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-94.0,"y":-169.0},"guid":"d4d7c6b1-f2a3-47cf-95cd-6c480d5b785a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"55"},{"argumentCount":4,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Alert","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":168.0,"y":-94.0},"guid":"daf4ea78-1897-4964-905d-c3da20081f97","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"57"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Welcome","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-283.0,"y":69.0},"guid":"d0a25969-a22a-4354-9cac-32fe70ce9f8f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"59"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-227.0,"y":-79.0},"guid":"3ddf2acb-62f0-4e39-bcf5-6f2c886fb1dc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"61"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Though
      the battle has only begun, frightened men are already abandoning the line.\\n\\nBritish
      cannon fire will continue to <b><color=#FF5C5C>drain morale</color></b>. If
      your troops lose <b><color=#FF5C5C>all morale</color></b>, they will <b><color=#B22222>panic,
      break, and flee</color></b>.\\n\\nPull soldiers <b><color=#D6B25E>back from
      the main line</color></b> when needed so they can <b><color=#4DA6FF>recover
      morale</color></b>.\\n\\n<b><color=#4DA6FF>Watch the blue bar</color></b>.
      Once fear spreads, you will not stop it.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-4.0,"y":379.0},"guid":"ca46c7c5-09cd-4817-a6ee-340b0fe621a4","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"63"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Welcome
      to the Colonial","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-95.0,"y":207.0},"guid":"f34eab09-96c2-439c-9be7-26832476c3a9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"65"},{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-476.0,"y":-80.0},"guid":"ac332add-68f3-41a1-a681-8a151812c002","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Start","$id":"67"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Button","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":230.0,"y":-528.0},"guid":"1653b8e9-355f-41e4-bb7e-549903313cab","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"69"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"CLOSE","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-105.0,"y":98.0},"guid":"9b598b8b-e6c1-46da-a751-002bf23fb92c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"71"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"TextMain","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-198.0,"y":-586.0},"guid":"496fc1ad-69e2-460b-ab0e-36c7489966d5","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"73"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":463.0,"y":-384.0},"guid":"a091604a-622b-46b0-9f8e-153c1bfac977","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"75"},{"chainable":false,"member":{"name":"timeScale","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"UnityEngine.Time","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.Time","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"input":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Single"}},"position":{"x":696.0,"y":-387.0},"guid":"fa32cd50-4657-4408-a771-a01e4884677e","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetMember","$id":"79"},{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Time","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":614.0,"y":-69.0},"guid":"816793b3-caad-462d-ad72-75d61860fc6e","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.BoltUnityEvent","$id":"82"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"TextTitle","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":16.0,"y":-550.0},"guid":"70b9f67a-bf34-49e6-bdbd-9c5c64eb03e0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"84"},{"argumentCount":1,"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"Health","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-402.0,"y":1009.0},"guid":"58077ed9-ee5d-4a15-9216-a29027cf54ec","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent","$id":"86"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Welcome
      to the Colonial","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":27.0,"y":1312.0},"guid":"df947164-18c6-49e9-80cc-f4f718de0a46","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"88"},{"argumentCount":4,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Alert","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":290.0,"y":1011.0},"guid":"341220ee-73c8-4f95-819c-c7c096af90da","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"90"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Health","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-161.0,"y":1174.0},"guid":"241b7dc9-d86c-4739-8315-25c07286b78c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"92"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"<b><color=#D6B25E>Men
      Will Fall</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":29.0,"y":1100.0},"guid":"d2e68941-ba27-460e-9460-eaf26bccaae0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"94"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"GO
      TO","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":17.0,"y":1203.0},"guid":"8fd86bdd-edd9-4b76-8b2a-84e3caa9b6ff","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"96"},{"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Health","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":496.0,"y":1025.0},"guid":"7aaf2f25-12a1-4908-ad42-a5c5aa1ebb5d","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"98"},{"type":"System.Boolean","value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":497.0,"y":1169.0},"guid":"6f31eccc-b307-411a-a7e7-f54960be8652","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"100"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-105.0,"y":1026.0},"guid":"750cbc53-e1fa-48e9-84b2-eff975780911","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"102"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"The
      hill is paid for in blood, Commander, and the British mean to collect it.\\n\\nEnemy
      fire will <b><color=#FF5C5C>drain troop health</color></b> without mercy. As
      health drops, your men will die, and the line will thin until it can no longer
      stand.\\n\\nDo not spend lives carelessly. Every loss makes the next assault
      harder to survive.\\n\\n<b><color=#4CAF50>Watch the green bar</color></b>.
      If too many men fall, this defense dies with them.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":25.0,"y":927.0},"guid":"eeadd366-ce51-419a-a48f-56e011a313b3","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"104"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"cam","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":735.0,"y":1237.0},"guid":"c5ccddc1-3f40-44f8-84d4-031d5d737cfb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"106"},{"argumentCount":1,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GoTo","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":766.0,"y":1015.0},"guid":"3efc8326-9cd3-42bd-8c24-9d0d7706eeef","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"108"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"cam","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":663.0,"y":678.0},"guid":"7003317b-db89-436d-99db-d02610540edc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"110"},{"argumentCount":1,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GoTo","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":694.0,"y":456.0},"guid":"87b29834-d0de-4084-b232-bf6547d15a57","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"112"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"57"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"22"},"destinationKey":"assign","guid":"92c2a42f-f41a-4b48-ac49-98191c03a483","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"14"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"18"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"d4cb304a-55ae-497e-a414-4298b23f4433","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"30"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"40"},"destinationKey":"assign","guid":"b8d25834-41b6-42a0-aff2-54251ab6f45d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"51"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"30"},"destinationKey":"enter","